{'symbol': 'MOH', 'date': '2022-02-25 19:57:00', 'title': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE SET TO JOIN S&P 500; RANGE RESOURCES TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; GOLDEN ENTERTAINMENT TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P MIDCAP 400 CONSTITUENT MOLINA HEALTHCARE INC. (NYSE:MOH) WILL REPLACE IHS MARKIT LTD (NYSE:INFO) IN THE S&P 500, S&P SMALLCAP 600 CONSTITUENT RANGE RESOURCES CORP. (NYSE:RRC) WILL REPLACE MOLINA HEALTHCARE IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400, AND GOLDEN ENTERTAINMENT INC. (NASD:GDEN) WILL REPLACE RANGE RESOURCES IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, MARCH 2. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT S&P GLOBAL INC. (NYSE: SPGI) IS ACQUIRING IHS MARKIT IN A TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON FEBRUARY 28.'}